  ('lesson-gita-03-001', 'en', 'Bhagavad Gita 3.1', 'Study Shloka 3.1 in Devanagari, Roman transliteration and source word glosses.', 'Duty, contribution and action without possessive attachment. How can daily work become disciplined service rather than a source of bondage?', 'Complete the study and continue to Shloka 3.2.'),
