  ('text-gita-01-013-latn', 'release-lb-gita-open-c6fce3959544', 'verse-gita-01-013', 'sa', 'Latn', 'transliteration', 'tataḥ śhaṅkhāśhcha bheryaśhcha paṇavānaka-gomukhāḥ
