  ('text-gita-01-015-orya', 'release-lb-gita-open-c6fce3959544', 'verse-gita-01-015', 'sa', 'Orya', 'script-transliteration', 'ପାଞ୍ଚଜନ୍ଯଂ ହୃଷୀକେଶୋ ଦେଵଦତ୍ତଂ ଧନଂଜଯଃ।
