  ('text-gita-01-030-latn', 'release-lb-gita-open-c6fce3959544', 'verse-gita-01-030', 'sa', 'Latn', 'transliteration', 'gāṇḍīvaṁ sraṁsate hastāt tvak chaiva paridahyate
