  ('text-gita-01-034-latn', 'release-lb-gita-open-c6fce3959544', 'verse-gita-01-034', 'sa', 'Latn', 'transliteration', 'āchāryāḥ pitaraḥ putrās tathaiva cha pitāmahāḥ
