  ('text-gita-01-037-latn', 'release-lb-gita-open-c6fce3959544', 'verse-gita-01-037', 'sa', 'Latn', 'transliteration', 'tasmān nārhā vayaṁ hantuṁ dhārtarāṣhṭrān sa-bāndhavān
