  ('text-gita-02-019-latn', 'release-lb-gita-open-c6fce3959544', 'verse-gita-02-019', 'sa', 'Latn', 'transliteration', 'ya enaṁ vetti hantāraṁ yaśh chainaṁ manyate hatam
