  ('text-gita-02-021-orya', 'release-lb-gita-open-c6fce3959544', 'verse-gita-02-021', 'sa', 'Orya', 'script-transliteration', 'ଵେଦାଵିନାଶିନଂ ନିତ୍ଯଂ ଯ ଏନମଜମଵ୍ଯଯମ୍।
