  ('text-gita-02-024-orya', 'release-lb-gita-open-c6fce3959544', 'verse-gita-02-024', 'sa', 'Orya', 'script-transliteration', 'ଅଚ୍ଛେଦ୍ଯୋଽଯମଦାହ୍ଯୋଽଯମକ୍ଲେଦ୍ଯୋଽଶୋଷ୍ଯ ଏଵ ଚ।
