  ('text-gita-02-044-orya', 'release-lb-gita-open-c6fce3959544', 'verse-gita-02-044', 'sa', 'Orya', 'script-transliteration', 'ଭୋଗୈଶ୍ଵର୍ଯପ୍ରସକ୍ତାନାଂ ତଯାପହୃତଚେତସାମ୍।
