  ('text-gita-02-048-latn', 'release-lb-gita-open-c6fce3959544', 'verse-gita-02-048', 'sa', 'Latn', 'transliteration', 'yoga-sthaḥ kuru karmāṇi saṅgaṁ tyaktvā dhanañjaya
