  ('text-gita-02-051-latn', 'release-lb-gita-open-c6fce3959544', 'verse-gita-02-051', 'sa', 'Latn', 'transliteration', 'karma-jaṁ buddhi-yuktā hi phalaṁ tyaktvā manīṣhiṇaḥ
