  ('text-gita-02-070-orya', 'release-lb-gita-open-c6fce3959544', 'verse-gita-02-070', 'sa', 'Orya', 'script-transliteration', 'ଆପୂର୍ଯମାଣମଚଲପ୍ରତିଷ୍ଠଂ
