  ('text-gita-03-004-latn', 'release-lb-gita-open-c6fce3959544', 'verse-gita-03-004', 'sa', 'Latn', 'transliteration', 'na karmaṇām anārambhān naiṣhkarmyaṁ puruṣho ’śhnute
