  ('text-gita-03-005-latn', 'release-lb-gita-open-c6fce3959544', 'verse-gita-03-005', 'sa', 'Latn', 'transliteration', 'na hi kaśhchit kṣhaṇam api jātu tiṣhṭhatyakarma-kṛit
