  ('text-gita-03-008-latn', 'release-lb-gita-open-c6fce3959544', 'verse-gita-03-008', 'sa', 'Latn', 'transliteration', 'niyataṁ kuru karma tvaṁ karma jyāyo hyakarmaṇaḥ
