  ('text-gita-04-008-latn', 'release-lb-gita-open-c6fce3959544', 'verse-gita-04-008', 'sa', 'Latn', 'transliteration', 'paritrāṇāya sādhūnāṁ vināśhāya cha duṣhkṛitām
