  ('text-gita-04-010-latn', 'release-lb-gita-open-c6fce3959544', 'verse-gita-04-010', 'sa', 'Latn', 'transliteration', 'vīta-rāga-bhaya-krodhā man-mayā mām upāśhritāḥ
