  ('text-gita-04-012-latn', 'release-lb-gita-open-c6fce3959544', 'verse-gita-04-012', 'sa', 'Latn', 'transliteration', 'kāṅkṣhantaḥ karmaṇāṁ siddhiṁ yajanta iha devatāḥ
