  ('text-gita-04-015-latn', 'release-lb-gita-open-c6fce3959544', 'verse-gita-04-015', 'sa', 'Latn', 'transliteration', 'evaṁ jñātvā kṛitaṁ karma pūrvair api mumukṣhubhiḥ
