  ('text-gita-04-018-latn', 'release-lb-gita-open-c6fce3959544', 'verse-gita-04-018', 'sa', 'Latn', 'transliteration', 'karmaṇyakarma yaḥ paśhyed akarmaṇi cha karma yaḥ
