  ('text-gita-04-022-orya', 'release-lb-gita-open-c6fce3959544', 'verse-gita-04-022', 'sa', 'Orya', 'script-transliteration', 'ଯଦୃଚ୍ଛାଲାଭସନ୍ତୁଷ୍ଟୋ ଦ୍ଵନ୍ଦ୍ଵାତୀତୋ ଵିମତ୍ସରଃ।
