  ('text-gita-04-027-latn', 'release-lb-gita-open-c6fce3959544', 'verse-gita-04-027', 'sa', 'Latn', 'transliteration', 'sarvāṇīndriya-karmāṇi prāṇa-karmāṇi chāpare
