  ('text-gita-04-029-latn', 'release-lb-gita-open-c6fce3959544', 'verse-gita-04-029', 'sa', 'Latn', 'transliteration', 'apāne juhvati prāṇaṁ prāṇe ’pānaṁ tathāpare
