  ('text-gita-04-033-latn', 'release-lb-gita-open-c6fce3959544', 'verse-gita-04-033', 'sa', 'Latn', 'transliteration', 'śhreyān dravya-mayād yajñāj jñāna-yajñaḥ parantapa
