  ('text-gita-05-024-latn', 'release-lb-gita-open-c6fce3959544', 'verse-gita-05-024', 'sa', 'Latn', 'transliteration', 'yo ''ntaḥ-sukho ''ntar-ārāmas tathāntar-jyotir eva yaḥ
