  ('text-gita-05-027-latn', 'release-lb-gita-open-c6fce3959544', 'verse-gita-05-027', 'sa', 'Latn', 'transliteration', 'sparśhān kṛitvā bahir bāhyānśh chakṣhuśh chaivāntare bhruvoḥ
