  ('text-gita-06-016-latn', 'release-lb-gita-open-c6fce3959544', 'verse-gita-06-016', 'sa', 'Latn', 'transliteration', 'nātyaśhnatastu yogo ’sti na chaikāntam anaśhnataḥ
