  ('text-gita-06-021-latn', 'release-lb-gita-open-c6fce3959544', 'verse-gita-06-021', 'sa', 'Latn', 'transliteration', 'sukham ātyantikaṁ yat tad buddhi-grāhyam atīndriyam
