ତସ୍ଯାହଂ ନିଗ୍ରହଂ ମନ୍ଯେ ଵାଯୋରିଵ ସୁଦୁଷ୍କରମ୍॥', JSON_ARRAY(1), NULL, NULL, 'Bhagavad Gita 6.34; Sanskrit rendered in Odia script', 'generated-review'),
  ('text-gita-06-035-deva', 'release-lb-gita-open-c6fce3959544', 'verse-gita-06-035', 'sa', 'Deva', 'canonical-script', 'श्री भगवानुवाच
असंशयं महाबाहो मनो दुर्निग्रहं चलं।
अभ्यासेन तु कौन्तेय वैराग्येण च गृह्यते॥', JSON_ARRAY(1, 2), NULL, NULL, 'Bhagavad Gita 6.35', 'published'),
  ('text-gita-06-035-latn', 'release-lb-gita-open-c6fce3959544', 'verse-gita-06-035', 'sa', 'Latn', 'transliteration', 'śhrī bhagavān uvācha
asanśhayaṁ mahā-bāho mano durnigrahaṁ chalam
abhyāsena tu kaunteya vairāgyeṇa cha gṛihyate', JSON_ARRAY(1, 2), NULL, NULL, 'Bhagavad Gita 6.35; source transliteration', 'source-import'),
  ('text-gita-06-035-orya', 'release-lb-gita-open-c6fce3959544', 'verse-gita-06-035', 'sa', 'Orya', 'script-transliteration', 'ଶ୍ରୀ ଭଗଵାନୁଵାଚ
ଅସଂଶଯଂ ମହାବାହୋ ମନୋ ଦୁର୍ନିଗ୍ରହଂ ଚଲଂ।
ଅଭ୍ଯାସେନ ତୁ କୌନ୍ତେଯ ଵୈରାଗ୍ଯେଣ ଚ ଗୃହ୍ଯତେ॥', JSON_ARRAY(1, 2), NULL, NULL, 'Bhagavad Gita 6.35; Sanskrit rendered in Odia script', 'generated-review'),
  ('text-gita-06-036-deva', 'release-lb-gita-open-c6fce3959544', 'verse-gita-06-036', 'sa', 'Deva', 'canonical-script', 'असंयतात्मना योगो दुष्प्राप इति मे मतिः।
