aprāpya yoga-sansiddhiṁ kāṅ gatiṁ kṛiṣhṇa gachchhati', JSON_ARRAY(1, 2), NULL, NULL, 'Bhagavad Gita 6.37; source transliteration', 'source-import'),
  ('text-gita-06-037-orya', 'release-lb-gita-open-c6fce3959544', 'verse-gita-06-037', 'sa', 'Orya', 'script-transliteration', 'ଅର୍ଜୁନ ଉଵାଚ
ଅଯତିଃ ଶ୍ରଦ୍ଧଯୋପେତୋ ଯୋଗାଚ୍ଚଲିତମାନସଃ।
ଅପ୍ରାପ୍ଯ ଯୋଗସଂସିଦ୍ଧିଂ କାଂ ଗତିଂ କୃଷ୍ଣ ଗଚ୍ଛତି॥', JSON_ARRAY(1, 2), NULL, NULL, 'Bhagavad Gita 6.37; Sanskrit rendered in Odia script', 'generated-review'),
  ('text-gita-06-038-deva', 'release-lb-gita-open-c6fce3959544', 'verse-gita-06-038', 'sa', 'Deva', 'canonical-script', 'कच्चिन्नोभयविभ्रष्टश्छिन्नाभ्रमिव नश्यति।
