  ('text-gita-06-039-latn', 'release-lb-gita-open-c6fce3959544', 'verse-gita-06-039', 'sa', 'Latn', 'transliteration', 'etan me sanśhayaṁ kṛiṣhṇa chhettum arhasyaśheṣhataḥ
