  ('text-gita-06-045-latn', 'release-lb-gita-open-c6fce3959544', 'verse-gita-06-045', 'sa', 'Latn', 'transliteration', 'prayatnād yatamānas tu yogī sanśhuddha-kilbiṣhaḥ
