  ('text-gita-06-046-orya', 'release-lb-gita-open-c6fce3959544', 'verse-gita-06-046', 'sa', 'Orya', 'script-transliteration', 'ତପସ୍ଵିଭ୍ଯୋଽଧିକୋ ଯୋଗୀ ଜ୍ଞାନିଭ୍ଯୋଽପି ମତୋଽଧିକଃ।
