  ('text-gita-07-002-latn', 'release-lb-gita-open-c6fce3959544', 'verse-gita-07-002', 'sa', 'Latn', 'transliteration', 'jñānaṁ te ’haṁ sa-vijñānam idaṁ vakṣhyāmyaśheṣhataḥ
