  ('text-gita-07-002-orya', 'release-lb-gita-open-c6fce3959544', 'verse-gita-07-002', 'sa', 'Orya', 'script-transliteration', 'ଜ୍ଞାନଂ ତେଽହଂ ସଵିଜ୍ଞାନମିଦଂ ଵକ୍ଷ୍ଯାମ୍ଯଶେଷତଃ।
