  ('text-gita-09-019-orya', 'release-lb-gita-open-c6fce3959544', 'verse-gita-09-019', 'sa', 'Orya', 'script-transliteration', 'ତପାମ୍ଯହମହଂ ଵର୍ଷଂ ନିଗୃହ୍ଣାମ୍ଯୁତ୍ସୃଜାମି ଚ।
