  ('text-gita-09-023-latn', 'release-lb-gita-open-c6fce3959544', 'verse-gita-09-023', 'sa', 'Latn', 'transliteration', 'ye ’pyanya-devatā-bhaktā yajante śhraddhayānvitāḥ
