  ('text-gita-09-025-latn', 'release-lb-gita-open-c6fce3959544', 'verse-gita-09-025', 'sa', 'Latn', 'transliteration', 'yānti deva-vratā devān pitṝīn yānti pitṛi-vratāḥ
