  ('text-gita-09-026-latn', 'release-lb-gita-open-c6fce3959544', 'verse-gita-09-026', 'sa', 'Latn', 'transliteration', 'patraṁ puṣhpaṁ phalaṁ toyaṁ yo me bhaktyā prayachchhati
