  ('text-gita-10-013-latn', 'release-lb-gita-open-c6fce3959544', 'verse-gita-10-013', 'sa', 'Latn', 'transliteration', 'āhus tvām ṛiṣhayaḥ sarve devarṣhir nāradas tathā
