  ('text-gita-11-024-orya', 'release-lb-gita-open-c6fce3959544', 'verse-gita-11-024', 'sa', 'Orya', 'script-transliteration', 'ନଭଃସ୍ପୃଶଂ ଦୀପ୍ତମନେକଵର୍ଣଂ
