  ('text-gita-13-004-latn', 'release-lb-gita-open-c6fce3959544', 'verse-gita-13-004', 'sa', 'Latn', 'transliteration', 'tat kṣhetraṁ yach cha yādṛik cha yad-vikāri yataśh cha yat
