  ('text-gita-13-019-latn', 'release-lb-gita-open-c6fce3959544', 'verse-gita-13-019', 'sa', 'Latn', 'transliteration', 'iti kṣhetraṁ tathā jñānaṁ jñeyaṁ choktaṁ samāsataḥ
