  ('text-gita-16-021-latn', 'release-lb-gita-open-c6fce3959544', 'verse-gita-16-021', 'sa', 'Latn', 'transliteration', 'tri-vidhaṁ narakasyedaṁ dvāraṁ nāśhanam ātmanaḥ
