  ('text-gita-16-023-latn', 'release-lb-gita-open-c6fce3959544', 'verse-gita-16-023', 'sa', 'Latn', 'transliteration', 'yaḥ śhāstra-vidhim utsṛijya vartate kāma-kārataḥ
