  ('text-gita-17-023-latn', 'release-lb-gita-open-c6fce3959544', 'verse-gita-17-023', 'sa', 'Latn', 'transliteration', 'oṁ tat sad iti nirdeśho brahmaṇas tri-vidhaḥ smṛitaḥ
