  ('text-gita-18-031-latn', 'release-lb-gita-open-c6fce3959544', 'verse-gita-18-031', 'sa', 'Latn', 'transliteration', 'yayā dharmam adharmaṁ cha kāryaṁ chākāryam eva cha
