  ('text-gita-18-046-latn', 'release-lb-gita-open-c6fce3959544', 'verse-gita-18-046', 'sa', 'Latn', 'transliteration', 'yataḥ pravṛittir bhūtānāṁ yena sarvam idaṁ tatam
