  ('text-gita-18-047-latn', 'release-lb-gita-open-c6fce3959544', 'verse-gita-18-047', 'sa', 'Latn', 'transliteration', 'śhreyān swa-dharmo viguṇaḥ para-dharmāt sv-anuṣhṭhitāt
